            %p
          %h4#PresentationOfPureBraids Presentation of pure braids
          %p
            Similarly, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pure+braid+group"} pure braid group
            has a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/finitely+presented+group"} finite presentation
          %p One possible set of generators (also originally considered by Artin) are the “weave” braids where one strands lassos exactly one other strand:
